248	  //
249	  // Age comes from the FILENAME stamp, not from git/commit metadata. Commit dates
250	  // are the authoritative record of when a blob landed, but they are the wrong
251	  // authority here and cost more: (a) AGREEMENT — the consuming task's prune rule
252	  // is itself stated over the filename stamp ("each log whose filename stamp is
