559	      // The workflow's failure-continuation job (needs: execute, if:
560	      // failure() || cancelled()) re-dispatches on a fresh runner, so a dead
561	      // run never stalls the train — the crashed ITEM still waits for the
562	      // leash reclaim; only the QUEUE keeps moving (S36).
